<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">AFilimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">AFil</para>
  <para style="toc2">AFilimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na aFilimon</para>
  <para style="mt1">AFilimon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na aFilimon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Kufumung e ne ni imi aBulus, afi inyang mok Anet-Isheshek aYeso nɛ aTimoti aruneng yit, sak na aFilimon afidang yit nɛ afidang itomong yit, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />nɛ anganeng yit Afiya nɛ Akipus afidang yit ni itsom nɛ bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nyiis ari ngɔn:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Won itek ni kusot kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa aYeso Kristi ni ku se ni yin.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifeng nɛ awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />In nesek Adakunom in ifeng ni izen fi in da yiring na awon, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />nek ni ifoos inɔɔk atsak ngɔn na aTisa aYeso, ni ishim fi ibɛ nek banet Adakunom kusum. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />In ra won, fok ni i ya kashon ayɛt inɔɔk atsak fi i ki moon yit, nɔng i da bin sɛ atsik irēn ngma nkyɔrɔk ntek fi in bɛ yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ishim fi ibɛ, mi di barang mo agap makiyi aruneng, i mi tɛrɛk banet Adakunom ayɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akabɔk fɛ́ aBulus tsɛt <optbreak /> nek aOnisimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Nek anɔng, ngma ni kukyem fi in bɛ ayɛt Anet-Isheshek ni in fɛ̀ ni ngɔn ni i nye ikyɛng fi in fi in shim, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ngma na anɔng, in tsin ra awon ni ngɔn nek ishim. Imi aBulus ni ikop in, ni kusot hom tɛ afi inyang Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />In tsin ra awon ni ngɔn akuce ari hom aOnisimus. A sot ari hom ni imi ari inyang. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />A tsang yet aduk anet ni ngɔn, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng a mi sot anet atek sak ni yit ngma.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />In tsin ku yirik ni ngɔn, ti icek iyɛ hom. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Zɔng ki in ku won azeng ni imi, nɔng a di ki nyes ikyɛng fi ngɔn tsang di ras e, ni inyang deng fi in se ne nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Awɛt in shim in ra ikyikak dang irēn ngɔn awo, nɔng itek ngɔn nye da sot tɛ ba da te mo i inɛn awo tit ni ishim iyɛ ngɔn. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Nyɛn ikyɛng fi i sak ba da kam ni wu nfi kizen gyet, nɔng a da tɛ bun ni ngɔn vit nkum e, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />da tɛ asam kong awo, tit tɛ anet atek, aruneng yit. A mi sot icek iyɛ ni mi, a da dung nye itek sak ni ngɔn, tɛ anet awe nɛ aruneng yit ni kuus Adakunom.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nek anɔng, ki ngɔn di sok tɛ afidang itomong ngɔn, ni ku shan ni mbɔk nfa, kpaf ti imi wu i tsin di shan. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Kɛ a mang da nye inɛn ke i ku kuus ikyikak ayi, ni yirik kuta me ni mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Imi aBulus wu in jɛk kufumung e kang ni kubɔk in. Imi da ka tarang. (I yet ikyɛng icɛɛt awo, ngɔn ice ngɔn bɛ kuta kutset kufas fi i sɛ ni mi.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Nek anɔng aruneng, won ni in sɛ ikyikak ni bɔk ngɔn ayɛt aTisa; di terek iyɛ nek Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />In tsin tɛ iyɛ fok i di ki fok, in tsin da jɛk e, in rēn fok i da nye kashon ni ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ ni ngɔn.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ikyɛng izining fi ikyɛk yet fok, di nye kutu batsen, nek in bi ite iyɛ fok in bin ki sɛ yin nek ishan awon yin.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Apafaras, afidang inyang hom ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, tsin da te show. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Ngma na aMarkus nɛ Aristakus, nɛ aDemas, nɛ aLuka, bafidang itomong in.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Won itek aTisa aYeso Kristi ni sot gung ni kabik yin.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>